  "post_content": "<p>La vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres s&#39;ha inaugurat l&#39;exposici&oacute; &#39;La festa de Sant Antoni&#39; a la Casa de la Cultura d&#39;Onda, acte que ha servit per homenatjar a t&iacute;tol p&ograve;stum Luciano Cervell&oacute; Izquierdo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/InauguExpoSantAntoniOnda.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La mostra estar&agrave; oberta fins al 21 de gener en horari, de dilluns a dissabte, de 10.00 h a 14.00 h i de 17.30 h a 20.30 h, i diumenges, d&#39;11.00 h a 14.00 h.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6611.jpg\" alt=\"img_6611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6613.jpg\" alt=\"img_6613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6620.jpg\" alt=\"img_6620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6621.jpg\" alt=\"img_6621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6624.jpg\" alt=\"img_6624\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6627.jpg\" alt=\"img_6627\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6629.jpg\" alt=\"img_6629\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposiciosantantoni17/img_6632.jpg\" alt=\"img_6632\" sty